      "parameters": {
        "width": 512,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "### Electronic Component Assistant with Automatic Datasheet Retrieval\n\nSearches a vector database of electronics datasheets to answer engineering questions.\n\nIf the required datasheet is not available, the workflow:\n\nsearches Google for a public PDF datasheet,\ndownloads and indexes it into Supabase,\nretries the search using the updated knowledge base,\nanswers the user's question using the retrieved datasheet.\n\n### Configure SerpAPI\n\nAdd your SerpAPI API key to the HTTP Request tool used for Google Search.\n\n### Configure Supabase\n\nBefore using the workflow:\n\ncreate the datasheets table\ncreate the match_documents RPC function\nenable the vector extension\nconfigure your Supabase credentials\n\n### Initial setup\n\nPublish this workflow.\nOpen the Update Database tool.\nSelect this workflow as the target workflow.\nSave and publish again."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
